Error [E0625]: A library package can't declare `fn run`
  --> tests/ui/library_package_run/run.jet:5:4
    |
  5 | fn run() {
    |    ^^^
 Why: A package is one namespace: an executable package has one `fn run`, or one in each entry file its `outputs` name, and a library package, which other code imports, has none.
 Fix: Move the program into its own package or a loose file that uses this library, or make this package an executable.
